  "created": "2026-08-18T01:25:42.7Z",
  "description": "A stdio-to-WebSocket pipe for the Agent Client Protocol. ACP agents speak\n      newline-delimited JSON-RPC over stdin and stdout, so a client can normally only reach an\n      agent it can spawn locally. `acp-bridge listen` runs where the agent lives, `acp-bridge\n      connect` runs where the client lives and stands in for the agent, and the conversation\n      between them is untouched.\n\n      It forwards bytes rather than decoding them, so no protocol version, message shape, or\n      future extension is something it can be wrong about.",
  "id": "AcpKit.Bridge",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-18T01:27:50.657Z",
